{"seq":81,"slug":"content-delivery-networks","title":"内容分发网络","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks","rating":{"composite":3.68,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"内容分发网络\">内容分发网络</h1><p>把一个网站的服务器放在北京机房，让大洋彼岸的用户访问，物理距离决定了光速无法逾越的延迟下限——一个 RTT 跨越太平洋至少要一百多毫秒，而一个现代页面动辄需要几十次往返。内容分发网络（CDN）就是为了消灭这段距离而生：它在全球数百个城市部署边缘节点，把内容复制到离用户最近的地方，让「最后一公里」变成「最后一公里」而不是「最后一万公里」。今天超过六成的网站流量经由 CDN 转发，它早已不只是「加速图片」的工具，而是承载缓存、安全、计算的互联网骨架层。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按四条主线层层递进，每一章都建立在前一章的基础之上。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」搭建地基：先讲清 CDN 到底解决什么问题、它的价值如何量化，再深入边缘节点（PoP）的物理与逻辑架构，最后剖析「用户的请求究竟如何被导向最近的节点」——DNS 与 Anycast 这两条请求路由路线。没有这三块地基，后面的缓存与交付都无从谈起。</p>\n<p>第二章「缓存机制」是 CDN 的心脏。它回答一个核心问题：如何让尽可能多的请求在边缘命中、不必回源。这一章拆成三层：内容在浏览器、边缘、中间层、源站之间如何分级缓存；用什么 HTTP 头和缓存键来精确控制「什么能缓存、缓存多久、按什么维度区分」；以及内容更新后如何快速失效与刷新。命中率每提升一个百分点，源站负载和用户延迟都会同步改善。</p>\n<p>第三章「内容交付」把缓存能力落到具体的内容类型上：静态资源与动态请求各自如何加速、为什么动态内容也能从 CDN 获益；视频流媒体这一最大流量来源如何借助 CMAF、LL-HLS 实现低延迟分发；以及连接本身的优化——边缘上的 TLS 终止与 HTTP/3 如何把握手和传输成本压到最低。</p>\n<p>第四章「进阶」是收口与深入：当边缘不再只是缓存而能运行代码时，边缘计算与边缘函数把逻辑推到离用户最近处；CDN 天然的分布式架构使它成为抵御 DDoS 与应用层攻击的第一道防线；最后，没有可观测性就无法优化，性能指标与日志体系让前面所有努力变得可度量、可调优。</p>\n<p>四章读完，你会看到一张完整的图景：从「为什么需要 CDN」到「请求如何路由」，从「如何缓存」到「如何交付」，再到「如何在边缘计算、防护与观测」。这不是孤立知识点的堆叠，而是一条从地基到屋顶的连贯路径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cdn-concepts","title":"CDN 概念与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/foundations/cdn-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pop-edge-architecture","title":"PoP 与边缘节点架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/foundations/pop-edge-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"request-routing","title":"请求路由：DNS 与 Anycast","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/foundations/request-routing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"caching","title":"缓存机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/caching","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cache-hierarchy","title":"多级缓存层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/caching/cache-hierarchy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cache-control-keys","title":"缓存控制与缓存键","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/caching/cache-control-keys"},{"seq":3,"slug":"invalidation-purging","title":"失效与刷新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/caching/invalidation-purging"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"delivery","title":"内容交付","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"static-dynamic-content","title":"静态与动态内容加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/delivery/static-dynamic-content"},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-streaming","title":"流媒体分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/delivery/media-streaming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tls-http3-edge","title":"边缘 TLS 与 HTTP/3","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/delivery/tls-http3-edge"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"edge-computing","title":"边缘计算与边缘函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/advanced/edge-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"security-ddos","title":"CDN 安全与 DDoS 防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/advanced/security-ddos"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-observability","title":"性能与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/content-delivery-networks/advanced/performance-observability"}]}]}